T*
(EXCLUSIONS, WAITING PERIODS AND COVERAGE EXCEPTIONS) Tj
T*
(============================================================================================) Tj
T*
(Demonstration Version 1.0 | Effective date: 01 April 2026) Tj
T*
(Document code: AIEHBP-EXC-005) Tj
T*
(Primary audience: Claims, medical reviewers, members and grievance teams) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
