(2. GENERAL EXCLUSIONS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(These exclusions apply after eligibility and benefit identification.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.1  Investigation without active treatment) Tj
T*
(   Admission primarily for evaluation, observation or diagnostics is excluded unless) Tj
T*
(   medically necessary active treatment or covered day-care is documented.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.2  Rest cure and custodial care) Tj
T*
(   Convalescent, respite, custodial, spa, wellness and non-clinical residential care are) Tj
T*
(   excluded.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.3  Cosmetic or aesthetic treatment) Tj
T*
(   Treatment primarily to alter appearance is excluded. Reconstructive treatment after) Tj
T*
(   covered accident, burn, cancer surgery or medically necessary correction is assessed) Tj
T*
(   under core cover.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.4  Obesity and weight control) Tj
T*
(   Weight reduction programmes, supplements and bariatric treatment are excluded unless an) Tj
T*
(   endorsement lists medically necessary bariatric surgery and its criteria are met.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.5  Gender affirmation) Tj
T*
(   Gender affirmation treatment is excluded under this fictional schedule unless a signed) Tj
T*
(   endorsement includes it. Production wording requires legal and compliance review.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.6  Hazardous or professional sport) Tj
T*
(   Injury from professional sport or specifically excluded high-risk competitive activity is) Tj
T*
(   excluded. Ordinary recreational exercise is not automatically hazardous.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.7  Breach of law) Tj
T*
(   Treatment arising directly from intentional participation in a criminal act may be) Tj
T*
(   excluded subject to evidence and applicable protections. A traffic allegation alone does) Tj
T*
(   not establish intentional criminal conduct.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.8  Substance misuse) Tj
T*
(   Treatment directly attributable to intentional misuse of intoxicants may be excluded, but) Tj
T*
(   emergency stabilization and legally protected treatment require separate review. A) Tj
T*
(   prescribed medicine is not misuse merely because it is controlled.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.9  Unproven or experimental treatment) Tj
T*
(   Treatment lacking accepted evidence or required approval is excluded. The medical) Tj
T*
(   reviewer must identify the evidence basis and distinguish approved modern treatment.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.10  Infertility and assisted reproduction) Tj
T*
(   Infertility evaluation, assisted conception, surrogacy-related expenses and sterilisation) Tj
T*
(   reversal are excluded unless endorsed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.11  Routine dental treatment) Tj
T*
(   Dental consultation, fillings, cleaning, dentures, orthodontics and non-accidental oral) Tj
T*
(   surgery are excluded. Emergency treatment of natural teeth damaged directly by a covered) Tj
T*
(   accident is included up to BEN-2.18.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.12  Vision and hearing aids) Tj
T*
(   Spectacles, contact lenses, hearing aids and routine refractive correction are excluded) Tj
T*
(   unless required as part of a covered procedure or endorsed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.13  Preventive and screening services) Tj
T*
(   Routine screening, vaccination and executive health checks are excluded unless the) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
