(   schedule expressly grants a preventive benefit. Diagnostic testing for symptoms or) Tj
T*
(   covered treatment is not routine screening.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.14  Non-medical convenience items) Tj
T*
(   Personal comfort, guest, communication and administrative items listed in BEN-6 are not) Tj
T*
(   payable.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.15  War and nuclear events) Tj
T*
(   Treatment directly caused by war, invasion, armed conflict or nuclear contamination is) Tj
T*
(   excluded, subject to applicable mandatory protections.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.16  Self-inflicted injury) Tj
T*
(   Intentional self-injury is subject to medical, mental-health, legal and policy review and) Tj
T*
(   must not be automatically denied by a text match. Emergency and protected care require) Tj
T*
(   appropriate handling.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.17  Maternity outside benefit) Tj
T*
(   Pregnancy, childbirth and related expenses exceeding or falling outside the maternity) Tj
T*
(   benefit are excluded, except unrelated illness and covered newborn complications assessed) Tj
T*
(   separately.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.18  Non-prescribed supplements) Tj
T*
(   Health supplements, vitamins and tonics without a treatment-linked prescription are) Tj
T*
(   excluded. Prescribed nutritional support integral to covered hospitalization is reviewed) Tj
T*
(   clinically.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.19  Overseas treatment) Tj
T*
(   Treatment outside India is excluded unless an international emergency endorsement is) Tj
T*
(   active.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-2.20  Excluded provider) Tj
T*
(   Treatment at a provider formally excluded for the date of service may be inadmissible,) Tj
T*
(   except emergency stabilization where law or endorsement requires review.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
