(3. WAITING-PERIOD EXCLUSIONS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(Waiting periods postpone otherwise covered treatment; they are not permanent exclusions.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-3.1  Initial thirty days) Tj
T*
(   Illness beginning or treated within the first thirty days is excluded unless due to) Tj
T*
(   covered accident or an endorsement waives the period.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-3.2  Specified twenty-four months) Tj
T*
(   Conditions named in BEN-4.2 are excluded until twenty-four months of continuous cover are) Tj
T*
(   completed, subject to continuity credit and accident exception.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-3.3  Pre-existing disease thirty-six months) Tj
T*
(   Treatment attributable to a validated pre-existing disease is excluded until thirty-six) Tj
T*
(   months of continuous cover, unless waived or reduced.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-3.4  Maternity nine months) Tj
T*
(   Maternity claims are excluded until nine months of continuous cover unless the employer) Tj
T*
(   endorsement waives the period.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-3.5  Date calculation) Tj
T*
(   Calculate completed waiting period on the admission or service date. Preserve) Tj
T*
(   prior-coverage credits and documented breaks according to the endorsement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
endstream
endobj
