(5. CARVE-BACKS AND EXCEPTIONS) Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
(These examples prevent overbroad exclusion application.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-5.1  Reconstruction) Tj
T*
(   Reconstructive surgery following a covered accident or cancer treatment may be covered) Tj
T*
(   despite the cosmetic exclusion.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-5.2  Accidental dental) Tj
T*
(   Treatment of natural teeth damaged directly in a covered accident may be covered despite) Tj
T*
(   routine dental exclusion.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-5.3  Diagnostic admission) Tj
T*
(   Diagnostics integral to active treatment or a recognized day-care procedure may be) Tj
T*
(   covered despite investigation-only exclusion.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-5.4  Prescribed nutrition) Tj
T*
(   Clinically necessary nutrition during covered critical care may be payable despite the) Tj
T*
(   supplement exclusion.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-5.5  Emergency provider) Tj
T*
(   Emergency stabilization may require separate consideration even when provider status is) Tj
T*
(   disputed.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
