T*
(   Confirm member, plan, policy version, service date, geography and endorsement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-6.2  Fact confirmation) Tj
T*
(   Confirm diagnosis status, treatment, causation and clinical context from reliable) Tj
T*
(   evidence.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-6.3  Clause match) Tj
T*
(   Record one or more exact clauses and explain each required element.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-6.4  Exception review) Tj
T*
(   Check benefits, carve-backs, waiting-period completion, continuity and endorsements.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-6.5  Authorization) Tj
T*
(   Obtain medical, compliance or senior review where required by AIEHBP-SOP-006.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(EXC-6.6  Communication) Tj
T*
(   Provide a plain-language reason, evidence, clause citation and grievance route.) Tj
T*
